      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `aa0ffa6463436fa66845b61b8055abdc937869e1daa7ff6e664651df1f2392c6--victims-of-fdv-related-offences.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2016\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 9 of 9\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 0964fa3cac42187bf211db630a08ab1f09ea4f3d88cd2b6d85a92c5aa3852d0f | missing |\n| \"Table 22\" | 3b32429728c8ff58f887d51fd0b6f094758cfe52556da94d45b50fc91e50e516 | missing |\n| \"Table 23\" | 1dbee074190c26008d1508ba47649b120a8b7ee23dd57f6604dabb1ac2613642 | missing |\n| \"Table 24\" | 4ee57f18ba0eb284c72cdc14c02da6cefaae71cd63b9fb9a32f2cea9ad8fe3d1 | missing |\n| \"Table 25\" | 39e3358969e3f5bdd46b3ef3abf675fbad655cd3038a2032f840b9303ba5f0de | missing |\n| \"Table 26\" | 120b7eca9fcf4114a863e01a71303a31acd4eb9f805cf5d67b51d535b69f8e07 | missing |\n| \"Table 27\" | 60beb7cd317ec63f2bb97bea4679cbf34972c81016180aa423b891f108fe73aa | missing |\n| \"Table 28\" | b0a12c561912aec48166fbbd542f6166ee5fe9f7b68a823512e3cea0ae720057 | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | 7e518477489f679d84940b75fcc586f0ce8aadd9f651b902688bdd6c30ac84d7 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
